+      <a href="https://www.pilieromazza.com/five-sba-7a-changes-that-could-reshape-business-acquisitions/" rel="noopener">PilieroMazza</a> &middot;
+      <a href="https://starfieldsmith.com/2025/05/best-practices-a-review-of-equity-injection-requirements-under-sop-50-10-8/" rel="noopener">Starfield &amp; Smith</a>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</section>
